sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant NC as NewsletterController
    participant NS as NewsletterService
    participant SR as SubscriberRepository
    participant MS as MailService
    participant DB as MySQL (newsletter_db)
    participant MAIL as Mailpit

    Note over FE,MAIL: Double Opt-In Subscribe Flow
    FE->>GW: POST /api/newsletter/public/subscribe
    GW->>NC: Forward (public, rate limited)
    NC->>NS: subscribe(request)
    NS->>SR: findByEmail(email)
    alt Already subscribed
        SR-->>NS: Subscriber found
        NS-->>NC: Already subscribed
    else New subscriber
        NS->>NS: Generate unique token
        NS->>SR: save(subscriber with status=PENDING)
        SR->>DB: INSERT INTO subscribers
        NS->>MS: send confirmation email with verify link
        MS->>MAIL: SMTP email
        NS-->>NC: Check your email
    end
    NC-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>FE: Response

    Note over FE,MAIL: Email Verification
    FE->>GW: GET /api/newsletter/verify?token=xxx
    GW->>NC: Forward
    NC->>NS: verify(token)
    NS->>SR: findByToken(token)
    SR->>DB: SELECT
    NS->>SR: save(subscriber with status=CONFIRMED)
    SR->>DB: UPDATE
    NS-->>NC: Subscription confirmed
    NC-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>FE: Response
